#: pf2_downloader.py:97
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Usage: PF2Downloader [COMMAND] [PATH]\n"
"Installation utility for Pre-Fortress 2\n"
"\n"
"If no arguments are provided, the downloader will be ran in setup mode, "
"in\n"
"which a series of questions will be asked to install the game for a "
"regular\n"
"user. This is what's used when opening the downloader from the desktop.\n"
"\n"
"Valid commands:\n"
"  --install           installs Pre-Fortress 2 into a new folder inside "
"PATH\n"
"  --update            updates the pre-existing Pre-Fortress 2 "
"installation in its\n"
"                      folder inside PATH\n"
"  --help              shows this\n"
"\n"
"PATH is the folder containing Pre-Fortress 2's folder. This is usually "
"the\n"
"sourcemods folder for clients, or the Source dedicated server folder for\n"
"servers.\n"
"\n"
"If PATH isn't provided, then it'll be replaced with the detected path to "
"the\n"
"sourcemods folder in the Steam directory. If it couldn't be detected, "
"then the\n"
"path will be the current work directory."
msgstr ""
"Uso: PF2Downloader [COMANDO] [RUTA]\n"
"Utilidad de instalación para Pre-Fortress 2.\n"
"\n"
"Si no se proporciona ningún argumento, el descargador se iniciará en modo"
"\n"
"instalación, donde se harán una serie de preguntas para instalar el juego"
"\n"
"para un usuario normal. Esto es lo que se usa al abrir el\n"
"descargador de escritorio.\n"
"\n"
"Comandos válidos:\n"
"  --Instalar en pc           instale Pre-Fortress 2 en una nueva carpeta "
"en PATH\n"
"  --actualizar            actualiza la instalación preexistente de Pre-"
"Fortress 2\n"
"                      en su carpeta dentro de PATH\n"
"  --ayudar              muestra esto\n"
"\n"
"PATH es la carpeta que contiene la carpeta Pre-Fortress 2. normalmente es"
" el\n"
"carpeta sourcemods para clientes, o la carpeta del servidor dedicado "
"Source\n"
"para servidores.\n"
"\n"
"Si no se proporciona PATH, se reemplazará con la ruta detectada a\n"
"la carpeta sourcemods en las carpetas de Steam. si no pudiera ser\n"
"detectado, entonces la ruta será la carpeta de trabajo actual."

